# Measures (G5b): durations divided by durations count whole times (R32).
contract Delivery
parties we, carrier
thing Goods
  due date
  per_day HKD
  days_late number
  full_weeks number
  fee HKD
can deliver by carrier
  -> delivered
  days_late = (now - due) / 1 day
  full_weeks = (now - due) / 1 week
  if days_late > 0
    fee = per_day * days_late
